  "description": "The Earth, swept away by the Third World War using nuclear bombs, drives humans and living things to the brink of extinction. A world that has lost the concept of a nation and has become nationalized. The Titan Company gradually recovers the devastated world using slimes and monopolizes resources while growing into a unique company on the planet. Titan has only one goal. Combining slimes and growing children to create a black hole on Earth. Then create a god who will make his ambitions come true. This is a story about the struggle between reckless Noah and cranky Ark.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63390583), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B0%B0%ED%8B%80%EC%8A%AC%EB%9D%BC%EC%9E%84/3921)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B0CWKSRD8X/)",
